/*
 * Intentionally empty.
 *
 * This shield adds no hardware -- the nice!view panel, its SPI bus and the
 * zephyr,display chosen node all come from ZMK's own `nice_view` shield, which
 * must be listed alongside this one. The only reason this file exists is that
 * Zephyr discovers shields by globbing for <shield>.overlay (see
 * zephyr/cmake/modules/shields.cmake): a shield directory with no overlay is
 * silently not a shield at all, and the build fails with "unknown shield".
 */

/ { };
